  "intro": {
    "text": "*Önce* (before), *sonra* (after) and *beri* (since) follow the ablative: *yemekten sonra*, *sabahtan beri*. For a length of time up to now, add `-DIr` to the span and keep the present: *İki saattir bekliyorum* (I've been waiting for two hours).",
    "see": "gp-duration-dir"
  },
